                  <SHORT-NAME>OcotpGetStatusApi</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">
                                            Compile switch to enable and disable the Ocotp_GetStatus function.
                                            true: API supported / function provided.
                                            false: API not supported / function not provided
                                            </L-2>
                  </DESC>
